          "prompt": "<p>What is the output of the following Java program? (Class A declares a public field x initialized to 1 and a setter setX(int a); class B extends A and defines getB() which calls setX(2) then returns x; Main creates one A and one B and prints a.x followed by a space and b.getB().)</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">x</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setX</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> a)</span> {\n        x = a;\n    }\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getB</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span> {\n        setX(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> x;\n    }\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Main</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n        <span class=\"hljs-type\">A</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span>();\n        <span class=\"hljs-type\">B</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">b</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span>();\n        System.out.println(a.x + <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot; &quot;</span> + b.getB());\n    }\n}</code></pre>|||<p>Kết quả của chương trình Java sau là gì? (Lớp A khai báo field public x khởi tạo bằng 1 và phương thức setX(int a); lớp B kế thừa A và định nghĩa getB() gọi setX(2) rồi trả về x; lớp Main tạo một đối tượng A và một đối tượng B rồi in ra a.x, một dấu cách, và b.getB().)</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">x</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setX</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> a)</span> {\n        x = a;\n    }\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getB</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span> {\n        setX(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> x;\n    }\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Main</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n        <span class=\"hljs-type\">A</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span>();\n        <span class=\"hljs-type\">B</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">b</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span>();\n        System.out.println(a.x + <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot; &quot;</span> + b.getB());\n    }\n}</code></pre>",
